{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.ParticleInteractions.confinement_frobenius_reciprocity","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.confinement_frobenius_reciprocity","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic"],"declarations":21,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.confinement_frobenius_reciprocity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.confinement_frobenius_reciprocity","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_frobenius_reciprocity.lean#L92-L116","doc":"**Confinement Frobenius reciprocity** ([`prop:confinement-frobenius-reciprocity`]).\n\nThe master claim: for every observable `O`, the physical expectation value in\nthe confined bound state `T` is the Gram-inverse dual pairing weighted by the\nLP-active shadow prices,\n\n    ⟨O⟩_T = ∑_{i,j ∈ A*(T)} u*ᵢ (G⁻¹)_{ij} ⟨O, bⱼ⟩ ,\n\ntogether with the LP supporting facts: (i) nontrivial primal optimum,\n(ii) positive net dual `y₀* > 0`, (iii) nonempty active set, (iv) active ⇔\npositive shadow price, (v) strong duality `primal_obj = dual_obj`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:confinement-frobenius-reciprocity","label":"prop:confinement-frobenius-reciprocity","md":"quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/confinement-frobenius-reciprocity.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.strong_duality","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.strong_duality","kind":"theorem","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_frobenius_reciprocity.lean#L90-L90","doc":"Strong duality.\n(Needs abstract LP duality infrastructure that does not exist in Mathlib; kept as an honest assumption for models without certificates) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.active_iff_pos_shadow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.active_iff_pos_shadow","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_frobenius_reciprocity.lean#L87-L87","doc":"Active ⇔ positive shadow price. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.A_star_nonempty","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.A_star_nonempty","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_frobenius_reciprocity.lean#L85-L85","doc":"Nonempty active set. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.y_0_star_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.y_0_star_pos","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_frobenius_reciprocity.lean#L83-L83","doc":"Positive net dual. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.primal_nontrivial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.primal_nontrivial","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_frobenius_reciprocity.lean#L81-L81","doc":"Nontrivial primal optimum. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.reciprocity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.reciprocity","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_frobenius_reciprocity.lean#L79-L79","doc":"Master reciprocity formula. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.physExp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.physExp","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_frobenius_reciprocity.lean#L77-L77","doc":"Physical expectation value `⟨O⟩_T = O(T)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.pairing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.pairing","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_frobenius_reciprocity.lean#L75-L75","doc":"Frobenius pairing `⟨O, bⱼ⟩ = tr_M(O · bⱼ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.Observable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.Observable","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_frobenius_reciprocity.lean#L73-L73","doc":"Observables `O ∈ H_n(q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.dual_obj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.dual_obj","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_frobenius_reciprocity.lean#L71-L71","doc":"Dual objective value `n_target · y₀*`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.primal_obj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.primal_obj","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_frobenius_reciprocity.lean#L69-L69","doc":"Primal objective value `∑ᵢ tᵢ x*ᵢ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.y_0_star","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.y_0_star","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_frobenius_reciprocity.lean#L67-L67","doc":"The net-constraint dual variable `y₀*`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.u_star","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.u_star","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_frobenius_reciprocity.lean#L65-L65","doc":"Dual shadow prices `u*ᵢ = y*ᵢ` on the active channels. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.x_star","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.x_star","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_frobenius_reciprocity.lean#L63-L63","doc":"Primal-optimum coefficients `x*ᵢ` (`T = ∑ x*ᵢ bᵢ`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.A_star","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.A_star","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_frobenius_reciprocity.lean#L61-L61","doc":"LP-active set `A*(T) = {i : y*ᵢ > 0}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.Ginv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.Ginv","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_frobenius_reciprocity.lean#L59-L59","doc":"The Frobenius dual-basis matrix `(G⁻¹)_{ij}` on the active subspace. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.G","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.G","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_frobenius_reciprocity.lean#L57-L57","doc":"The Frobenius Gram matrix `G_{ij} = tr_M(bᵢ bⱼ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.d","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.d","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_frobenius_reciprocity.lean#L55-L55","doc":"NF basis size `d`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_frobenius_reciprocity.lean#L53-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.ConfinementFrobeniusReciprocityContext","kind":"class","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/confinement_frobenius_reciprocity.lean#L49-L90","doc":"LP + Frobenius data of the confinement-reciprocity claim. All fields are\n*inputs* (LP primal/dual data, the Frobenius Gram matrix and its\nactive-subspace inverse, and the observable pairing); none asserts the\nreciprocity conclusion. ","signatureChunk":0}]}